[00:00.00] 作词 : Zach Bryan
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Zach Bryan
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Zach Bryan
[00:17.86] We've come a long way since those drunk days on backroads
[00:17.86] 自那些乡间小路的醉醺时光 我们已走过漫长旅程
[00:22.30] You and your high hopes always staying down
[00:22.30] 你和你的远大抱负 却总是陷入困境
[00:26.26] You always saw the best in me, high in yosemite, we hide
[00:26.26] 你总看见我最好的一面 在优胜美地的高处 我们藏匿
[00:34.41] Now I'm driving through reno, those goddamn casinos
[00:34.41] 此刻我驱车穿过里诺 那些该死的赌场
[00:38.82] You always kept god close
[00:38.82] 你总把上帝放在近旁
[00:40.86] Except that time you bet it all on black, came back to the room with twenty grand
[00:40.86] 除了那次你将一切押在黑色上 带着两万块回到房间
[00:46.84]
[00:49.56] And you were smiling like a thief with your cheek-tearing teeth
[00:49.56] 你笑得像个窃贼 露出撕裂脸颊的牙齿
[00:53.76] You was praying to jesus, we was running from the police
[00:53.76] 你在向耶稣祈祷 我们却在逃避警察
[00:58.26] They're using my muses to make fun of me
[00:58.26] 他们用我的缪斯来取笑我
[01:02.15] And your face up while your blood sucks from an iv
[01:02.15] 而你仰面躺着 血液正从输液管中流失
[01:06.49]
[01:09.66] We spent it all on gasoline, pch to cannon beach
[01:09.66] 我们把钱全花在汽油上 从太平洋海岸公路到坎农海滩
[01:14.06] Laid in the sand and, man, I have never seen
[01:14.06] 躺在沙滩上 老兄 我从未见过
[01:18.06] Something more beautiful than you and your cannonball
[01:18.06] 比你和你的炮弹跳更美丽的景象
[01:26.06] And we've come a long way since that shit banned at the blue list
[01:26.06] 自那玩意在蓝色名单上被禁 我们已走过漫长旅程
[01:30.61] You said anything other than another ****ing cover of "Only the good die young"
[01:30.61] 你说除了又一首该死的《Only the Good Die Young》翻唱 什么都行
[01:38.60]
[01:41.49] You were smiling like a thief with your cheek-tearing teeth
[01:41.49] 你笑得像个窃贼 露出撕裂脸颊的牙齿
[01:45.36] You was praying to jesus, we was running from the police
[01:45.36] 你在向耶稣祈祷 我们却在逃避警察
[01:49.81] They covered all the songs that are best kept alone
[01:49.81] 他们翻唱了所有本该独自珍藏的歌曲
[01:53.76] 'Cause your cannonball sits on cannon beach alone
[01:53.76] 因为你的炮弹独自落在坎农海滩上
[01:57.81] And they're using my muses to make fun of me
[01:57.81] 他们用我的缪斯来取笑我
[02:01.84] And your face up as your blood sucks from an iv
[02:01.84] 而你仰面躺着 血液正从输液管中流失
[02:06.13]
[02:09.21] And I never thought it'd be you
[02:09.21] 我从没想过会是你
[02:11.47] I always thought I'd beat you to the golden gates
[02:11.47] 总以为我会比你先抵达金色大门
[02:14.96] Won't you wait a few hours there by the door? We've all been here before
[02:14.96] 你能不能就在门边多等几小时 我们都曾到过这里
[02:25.30] But you stood up on your own, your mom called my telephone
[02:25.30] 但你独自挺立 你母亲拨通我的电话
[02:29.71] Said you've been standing and rambling about gambling
[02:29.71] 说你一直站着 胡言乱语着赌博的事
[02:33.70] And howling out in the night high in yosemite
[02:33.70] 在优胜美地的高处 对着黑夜嚎叫
[02:38.44]
[02:40.81] And you were smiling like a thief with your cheek-tearing teeth
[02:40.81] 你笑得像个窃贼 露出撕裂脸颊的牙齿
[02:44.81] You was praying to jesus, we was running from the police
[02:44.81] 你在向耶稣祈祷 我们却在逃避警察
[02:49.21] They sold off the town we used to call home
[02:49.21] 他们卖掉了我们曾称之为家的城镇
[02:53.10] And your cannonball sits on cannon beach alone
[02:53.10] 而你的炮弹独自落在坎农海滩上
[02:57.12]
